---
// Direction A: the opening carries no photograph. Composure comes from the
// margins and the type, so the page cannot be let down by an image — and the
// old full-bleed treatment used object-cover, which cropped the one real rug
// on the site down to a sliver behind the headline. Nothing here can crop.
---

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow text-graphite mb-8 sm:mb-10">
      Bespoke hand-tufted rugs, wall hangings and carpets
    </p>

    <h1 class="display text-4xl xs:text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl m-0 max-w-[16ch]">
      One rug. Yours. Never made twice.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-14 sm:mt-20 pt-8 border-t rule flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8">
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite m-0 max-w-[42ch]">
        Designed for the room it goes in, dyed to your colour and tufted to your
        dimensions &mdash; then never repeated for anyone else. Up to fifteen
        metres by ten. About four weeks from sign-off for a straightforward
        piece; larger and more complex commissions take longer.
      </p>

      <a href="/enquire" class="btn btn-primary shrink-0">Start a commission</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
